<bx:script>
	/**
	 * Small extra icon set for home.bxm's own marketing sections -
	 * bxsitesIcon() (icons.bxm) only covers social/repo/dark-mode/meta
	 * icons, not enough distinct concepts (themes, plugins, deploy,
	 * versions, Gradle/Maven/Spring...) to avoid every card in a 12-card
	 * grid falling back to the same generic globe glyph.
